# In the federation, engines/news holds the News pipeline CODE only. The
# world source of truth (data) lives in the external ~/news repo, which runs
# the live daily pipeline (see FEDERATION.md). Everything below is either
# runtime byproduct or world-SoR data and must never be committed here — a
# single pipeline run would otherwise add ~900 MB of graph snapshots back.
app/data/
app/sourcedata/
**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
app/.pytest_cache/
docs/data/
memory/
future-prediction/
report/
references.txt
